             rdfs:range frbrer:C1004;
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> frbrer:P2090;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an item to another item that has been derived in some way from the prior item. There can be varying levels of fidelity of the reproduction item to the prior item. The reproduction item must replicate the type of carrier and other physical characteristics of the prior item."@en.
frbrer:P2090 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "isAReproductionItemOfItem"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
