             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The component item may be a discrete physical unit of the prior item or may be an integral part that is physically inseparable from the whole of the prior item."@en.
frbrer:P2092 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "isPartItemOf"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
