             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The reproduction relationship will be stated at this level when it is useful to indicate the specific item used, as opposed to stating the relationship at the more general level of manifestation-to-manifestation."@en.
frbrer:P2094 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "isAReproductionManifestationOfItem"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
             a rdf:Property;
