             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to an expression of a prior work, the content of which represents the basis of a linear progression to that of the successor work. The content may be closely or loosely connected, so the successor work may be referential or autonomous with respect to the prior work."@en.
frbrer:P2097 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasASupplementWorkFromExpression"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
