             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to an expression of a prior work with which it is intended to be used in conjunction. The content may be closely or loosely associated, so the supplementary work may be referential or autonomous with respect to the prior work."@en.
frbrer:P2099 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasAComplementWorkFromExpression"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
             a rdf:Property;
             rdfs:domain frbrer:C1002;
