             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression of a prior work to another work that represents a modification of the content of the prior work for a purpose, use, or medium other than that for which it was originally intended. The modification of the content of the prior work must be sufficient in degree to warrant the adaption work being considered as a new work autonomous with respect to the prior work."@en.
