             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression of a prior work to another work that represents a transformation of the content of the prior work in a different genre. The modification of the content of the prior work must be sufficient in degree to warrant the transformation work being considered as a new work autonomous with respect to the prior work."@en.
