             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression that is a remote sensing image to the technique used to capture the image through remote sensing."@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., multispectral photography, infrared line scanning, SLAR, passive microwave mapping, etc."@en.
frbrer:P3071 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasSpecialCharacteristicRemoteSensingImage"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
