             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression that is a remote sensing image to the altitude and attitude of the sensor, the position of the platform, the category and name of the satellite, the number of spectral bands involved, the quality of the image, the extent of cloud cover, or the mean value of the ground resolution."@en.
frbrer:P3072 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasTechniqueGraphicOrProjectedImage"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
