             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., Baskerville, Times New Roman, etc."@en.
frbrer:P3075 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasTypeSizePrintedBook"@en;
