             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., a sheet folded twice to form a quarto, three times to form an octavo, etc."@en.
frbrer:P3077 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasCollationHandPrintedBook"@en;
