             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., four gatherings bearing signatures A through D."@en.
frbrer:P3078 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasPublicationStatusSerial"@en;
