             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., 33 1/3 rpm, 19 cm/s, etc."@en.
frbrer:P3081 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasGrooveWidth"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
