             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., microgroove--i.e., 200 grooves per inch."@en.
frbrer:P3082 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasKindOfCuttingSoundRecording"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
