             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., a first generation camera master, a second generation printing master, a third generation service copy, etc."@en.
frbrer:P3090 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasPresentationFormatVisualProjection"@en;
