             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation that is a remote electronic resource to the means of accessing it."@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., Internet, World Wide Web, etc."@en.
frbrer:P3096 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasAccessAddressRemoteElectronicResource"@en;
