             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., universal resource locator â€“ URL."@en.
frbrer:P3097 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasScaleCartographicImageOrObject"@en;
             <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001>;
