                        "has scale (cartographic image or object)"@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression that is cartographic to the ratio of distances in the expression to the actual distances they represent."@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Scale may apply to horizontal, vertical, angular, and, or, other distances represented in the expression."@en.
frbrer:P3098 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasProjectionCartographicImageOrObject"@en;
