             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., transverse Mercator, azimuthal equidistant, etc."@en.
frbrer:P3099 <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/RegAp/name> "hasPresentationTechniqueCartographicImageOrObject"@en;
