             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression that is cartographic to the technique used to depict the elevations or the inequalities of a land surface or of the bed of a body of water in a cartographic image."@en;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., contours, shading, hachures, spot heights, bathymetric tints, etc."@en.
